{
  "version": 1,
  "comments": {
    "c1": {
      "anchor": "i47",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "P30: a property body that's one bare expression on its own line is Don't understand",
      "excerpt": "P30: a property body that's one bare expression on its own line is Don't understand",
      "text": "A property with a single line should return the value\nSome languages do this automatically for functions as well, should we?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-07T13:37:36.531Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-07T13:44:18.163Z",
          "html": "<p>Answered in <a href=\"#i47\">I47</a>:  today a one-line property returns its line only when it can't be a statement, so a property whose one line is a call silently returns nothing, and an action never returns a bare line. Three rules to pick from;  I recommend B:  a one-line property always returns its line, and a one-line action returns its line only when it can only be a value.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-07T13:38:40.988Z"
      }
    },
    "c2": {
      "anchor": "i63",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "PokeSpell's last CSS: three looks Spell UI has no attribute for yet",
      "excerpt": "PokeSpell's last CSS: three looks Spell UI has no attribute for yet",
      "text": "suggest language",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-07T13:38:15.084Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-07T13:44:19.254Z",
          "html": "<p>Answered in <a href=\"#i63\">I63</a>:  a set of options for each of the four looks, built from Spell UI's own words, each with its Spanish name. Recommended:  <code>size=\"poster\"</code>, <code>font=\"heavy\"</code> and <code>shadow=\"yellow\"</code>;  <code>background=\"yellow\"</code> on a circular image;  <code>width</code>, <code>min-width</code>, <code>max-width</code>;  <code>stackable=\"34em\"</code> with <code>rotated=\"when stacked\"</code>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-07T13:38:42.154Z"
      }
    }
  },
